          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><i>Melee Weapon Attack:</i> [[/r 1d20+4]]{+4} to hit, reach 5 ft., one creature. <i>Hit:</i> 9 ([[/damage 2d6 + 2 type=necrotic]]) damage, and the target's Strength score is reduced by [[/r 1d4]]. The target dies if this reduces its Strength to 0. Otherwise, the reduction lasts until the target finishes a short or long rest.</p><p>If a non-evil humanoid dies from this attack, a new shadow rises from the corpse [[/r 1d4]] hours later.</p></div>",
